{"3921920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Discarded", "steam_appid": 3921920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discarded</strong> is a brutal roguelike arena shooter where survival means adapting fast — and killing faster. You're an out-of-work ex-soldier who's good at only one thing — and it's time to cash in. Face wave after wave of relentless enemies, upgrade your build, and fight for profit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No mercy. No excuses. Just you, your weapon, and your will to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/3cc0d3b618fd9da946ae624ab4f561fc.avif?t=1784884078\" width=607 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/6ae1ab23b3a45c7f2f5d039c45c9d7b5.poster.avif?t=1784884078\" width=606 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/6ae1ab23b3a45c7f2f5d039c45c9d7b5.webm?t=1784884078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/6ae1ab23b3a45c7f2f5d039c45c9d7b5.mp4?t=1784884078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Discarded</strong>, you’ll face a wide variety of enemies — from petty thieves and hired mercenaries, to aliens and decommissioned military robots. To spice things up, the arena management will throw in deadly hazards like high explosives, spike traps, landmines, poisonous gas, and much more — all to keep the crowd entertained. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try not to trip over a landmine — the janitors are getting tired of mopping up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/196cae519a44497b612e94ceaa6e42d7.avif?t=1784884078\" width=607 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/bc9797f6eb25cc55b77a437116a610e7.poster.avif?t=1784884078\" width=607 height=333 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/bc9797f6eb25cc55b77a437116a610e7.mp4?t=1784884078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to look like you know what you're doing? Take a pistol. Need to compensate for aim with bullets? Grab an SMG. Got patience and a god complex? Sniper’s for you. Or maybe you just want to make things disappear — in that case, say hello to the grenade launcher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/1c9f64c2b04ff19408cb49d918446c67.avif?t=1784884078\" width=607 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/7db4f3148c204d3725a56c4efeed2363.poster.avif?t=1784884078\" width=606 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/7db4f3148c204d3725a56c4efeed2363.webm?t=1784884078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/7db4f3148c204d3725a56c4efeed2363.mp4?t=1784884078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Better think twice about your choices — every upgrade comes with a downside. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sure, +50% damage sounds great… until you realize a mosquito can one-shot you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yeah, you built a glass cannon. Good luck with that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/3f0e7740b2e4476ec2ee548ca32fa381.avif?t=1784884078\" width=607 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/d43e228c02426bd12264917ffceb2f41.poster.avif?t=1784884078\" width=606 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/d43e228c02426bd12264917ffceb2f41.webm?t=1784884078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/d43e228c02426bd12264917ffceb2f41.mp4?t=1784884078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab whatever gun fits your style — just remember, hauling a high-caliber monster turns you into a walking turret… minus the armor. Enemies will see you coming from a mile away, and trust me — they’ll be ready. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But hey, at least you’ll look cool while getting shredded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of unique enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and create unique builds every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple weapon types to suit your playstyle</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discarded</strong> is a brutal roguelike arena shooter where survival means adapting fast — and killing faster. You're an out-of-work ex-soldier who's good at only one thing — and it's time to cash in. Face wave after wave of relentless enemies, upgrade your build, and fight for profit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No mercy. No excuses. Just you, your weapon, and your will to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/3cc0d3b618fd9da946ae624ab4f561fc.avif?t=1784884078\" width=607 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/6ae1ab23b3a45c7f2f5d039c45c9d7b5.poster.avif?t=1784884078\" width=606 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/6ae1ab23b3a45c7f2f5d039c45c9d7b5.webm?t=1784884078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/6ae1ab23b3a45c7f2f5d039c45c9d7b5.mp4?t=1784884078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Discarded</strong>, you’ll face a wide variety of enemies — from petty thieves and hired mercenaries, to aliens and decommissioned military robots. To spice things up, the arena management will throw in deadly hazards like high explosives, spike traps, landmines, poisonous gas, and much more — all to keep the crowd entertained. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try not to trip over a landmine — the janitors are getting tired of mopping up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/196cae519a44497b612e94ceaa6e42d7.avif?t=1784884078\" width=607 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/bc9797f6eb25cc55b77a437116a610e7.poster.avif?t=1784884078\" width=607 height=333 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/bc9797f6eb25cc55b77a437116a610e7.mp4?t=1784884078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to look like you know what you're doing? Take a pistol. Need to compensate for aim with bullets? Grab an SMG. Got patience and a god complex? Sniper’s for you. Or maybe you just want to make things disappear — in that case, say hello to the grenade launcher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/1c9f64c2b04ff19408cb49d918446c67.avif?t=1784884078\" width=607 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/7db4f3148c204d3725a56c4efeed2363.poster.avif?t=1784884078\" width=606 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/7db4f3148c204d3725a56c4efeed2363.webm?t=1784884078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921920/extras/7db4f3148c204d3725a56c4efeed2363.mp4?t=1784884078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Better think twice about your choices — every upgrade comes with a downside. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sure, +50% damage sounds great… until you realize a mosquito can one-shot you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yeah, you built a glass cannon. Good luck with that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span c